# .codex SECTION — Emerald Empire: History of Rokugan ("The Age of Heaven and
# Earth"). Stand-off graph over l5r5e-0.4-emerald-empire-history.lore (spec §25).
# Part of the L5R5e system graph. Built in era-batches; this file grows as each
# era of the chapter is folded in. Everything named gets a node; entities first
# introduced elsewhere (e.g. Shinomen Forest, Lady Doji) are AMENDED here by a
# hashless re-statement that adds this chapter's SOURCE and edges.

